patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-05T16:30:35Z"},"body":"Implements and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12165\r\nShould fix #105012.\r\n\r\nDifferent from proposal: the project settings have been changed to import options to better adjust individual texture compression.\r\n\r\nThis PR switchs the basis format to ktx2 format and adds import options that allow to enable zstd supercompression and [ Rate-Distortion Optimizated (RDO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rate%E2%80%93distortion_optimization) to significantly reduce disk size of basisu textures.\r\n\r\nAlso adds the same settings for PortableCompressedTexture2D.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}